      "title": "用户无需自备运行时",
      "items": [
        "Linux：install.sh [3/8] 下载并用 SHA256 校验 Node 24.16.0",
        "Windows：NSIS 直接内含 node.exe(88 MB) + dsh 依赖树(318 MB)",
        "科研 Python：Windows 捆绑 3.11，Linux 建 venv 3.12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "两条线共用一套裁剪纪律",
      "items": [
        "S1 vendor 白名单：Linux 归档 −54.9%（48.9→22.1 MiB）",
        "S2 摘 magika→onnxruntime：改为 magika 可选化补丁",
        "L2 剥第三方 tests 树：Windows 358.9→320.7 MB"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "扩展点与兼容补丁",
      "items": [
        "agent/turn-stopping 后重判 inbox.nextStep：插件可阻止回合结束",
        "capabilities / adapters / applications 三处收敛平台假设",
        "3 个 DSH 就地补丁：fake-invoke、SameSite cookie、剪贴板"
      ]
    }
  ]
